{%- comment -%}
  The closing spread: the scene, the notes, the two guides, the last action.

  No copy was removed. The three support items kept their exact wording but
  stopped being circle-icon tiles — that pattern had already appeared twice on
  this page and says "generic storefront" louder than it says anything about
  outdoor lighting. They are now the notes at the foot of the sheet, which is
  what they always were.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign atmosphere_collection = collections['גרילנדות-ותאורה-דקורטיבית']
  assign atmosphere_image = atmosphere_collection.image | default: atmosphere_collection.products.first.featured_image
-%}

<section class="en-close" dir="rtl" aria-labelledby="en-close-title-{{ section.id }}">
  <div class="en-close__wrap">

    <div class="en-close__scene">
      <div class="en-close__scene-media">
        {%- if atmosphere_image != blank -%}
          {{ atmosphere_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '480,640,720,840,960,1200,1400', sizes: '(max-width: 749px) 100vw, 50vw', alt: 'תאורת אווירה למרפסת ולגינה' }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <div class="en-close__scene-copy">
        <h2 id="en-close-title-{{ section.id }}">לא רק להאיר. להפוך את החוץ למקום שנעים להיות בו.</h2>
        {%- comment -%}
          "יכולה" was the only hedged verb on the page, sitting right under the
          most confident heading. Same facts, indicative mood — each verb is
          licensed by a published product description.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p class="en-close__lede">תאורה נכונה מקבלת את פניכם בכניסה, מובילה לאורך השביל ומוסיפה למרפסת אור חם שמזמין להישאר.</p>

        {%- comment -%}
          The schedule sold three places and offered one path — to the wrong
          place in two of the three cases. Each row now opens its own
          collection; not one word of the copy changed.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <ol class="en-close__places">
          <li><a class="en-close__place" href="{{ collections['solar-wall-lights'].url }}"><span class="en-close__idx"><bdi dir="ltr">01</bdi></span><b>כניסה וקירות</b><span class="en-close__what">אור שממסגר את הבית</span><span class="en-close__place-go" aria-hidden="true">←</span></a></li>
          <li><a class="en-close__place" href="{{ collections['תאורת-שביל-סולארית'].url }}"><span class="en-close__idx"><bdi dir="ltr">02</bdi></span><b>שביל וגינה</b><span class="en-close__what">נקודות אור לאורך הדרך</span><span class="en-close__place-go" aria-hidden="true">←</span></a></li>
          <li><a class="en-close__place" href="{{ collections['גרילנדות-ותאורה-דקורטיבית'].url }}"><span class="en-close__idx"><bdi dir="ltr">03</bdi></span><b>מרפסת ואירוח</b><span class="en-close__what">אווירה לערבים בחוץ</span><span class="en-close__place-go" aria-hidden="true">←</span></a></li>
        </ol>

        {%- if atmosphere_collection != blank -%}
          <a class="en-close__scene-cta" href="{{ atmosphere_collection.url }}">לתאורה דקורטיבית <span aria-hidden="true">←</span></a>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Note 2: "check every product page" put the brand's promised work on the
      reader; now it says we already wrote it there. Note 3: an offer of help
      phrased as permission became an instruction plus the committee's negative
      promise. Note 4 is new — the category's structural advantage (no
      electrician, no cables) existed on every solar product page and nowhere
      on this one; scoped to הסולארית so it never repeats the "רק סולארי"
      overclaim the committee killed.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <dl class="en-close__notes" aria-label="מידע שעוזר לבחור">
      <div><dt>קולקציות ממוקדות</dt><dd>קיר, שביל ואווירה — בלי ללכת לאיבוד בין קטגוריות לא קשורות.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>הפרטים לפני ההזמנה</dt><dd>בכל עמוד מוצר כתבנו את מקור החשמל, האפשרויות ואופן ההתקנה — כדי שתדעו מראש מה מתאים למקום שלכם.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>התקנה ללא חיבור לחשמל</dt><dd>בתאורה הסולארית אין כבלים ואין צורך להזמין חשמלאי — נטענת ביום ונדלקת לבד בלילה.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>צריכים עזרה בבחירה?</dt><dd>שלחו לנו קישור למוצר ותמונה של המקום — נבדוק התאמה, ואם לא מתאים נגיד מראש.</dd></div>
    </dl>

    <div class="en-close__learn" aria-labelledby="en-learn-title-{{ section.id }}">
      <h2 id="en-learn-title-{{ section.id }}">שני מדריכים קצרים שיעשו סדר</h2>
      <div class="en-close__guides">
        <a href="{{ pages['guide-garden-lighting'].url | default: routes.root_url }}">
          <strong>איך בוחרים תאורה לגינה?</strong>
          <span class="en-close__guide-what">לפי המקום, המטרה ואופן ההתקנה</span>
          <span class="en-close__guide-go">מדריך מעשי <b aria-hidden="true">←</b></span>
        </a>
        <a href="{{ pages['why-solar-lighting'].url | default: routes.root_url }}">
          <strong>מתי תאורה סולארית מתאימה?</strong>
          {%- comment -%}
            The teaser hid the differentiator. The quote is verbatim from the
            published guide itself — a live demonstration of "נגיד את זה
            מראש" at the exact point the buyer decides whether to click.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="en-close__guide-what">"היא לא תמיד מחליפה תאורה חשמלית חזקה" — המגבלות ומה חשוב לבדוק</span>
          <span class="en-close__guide-go">לפני שקונים <b aria-hidden="true">←</b></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="en-close__final">
      <div>
        <h2>כל תאורת החוץ, במקום אחד.</h2>
        {%- comment -%}
          The bookend: the 9/9/9 committee line returns at the last decision
          point, where it also justifies the help button beside it.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <p class="en-close__final-note">ואם מוצר לא מתאים למקום שלכם — נגיד את זה מראש.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="en-close__final-actions">
        <a class="is-primary" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">לכל המוצרים</a>
        <a href="{{ pages['contact-us'].url | default: routes.root_url }}">עזרה לפני ההזמנה</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
.en-close,.en-close *{box-sizing:border-box}
.en-close{
  --rule:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.16);
  --rule-strong:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.30);
  direction:rtl;padding:0 0 clamp(60px,7vw,92px);
  background:rgb(var(--en-surface-page));color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))
}
.en-close__wrap{width:min(1200px,100%);margin-inline:auto;padding-inline:clamp(18px,4vw,40px)}

/* The scene: the one place on this sheet that goes back outside at night. */
.en-close__scene{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);
  border:1px solid var(--rule-strong);background:rgb(var(--en-night))
}
.en-close__scene-media{min-height:100%}
.en-close__scene-media img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:brightness(.86)}
.en-close__scene-copy{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  padding:clamp(28px,4vw,52px);color:rgb(var(--en-ink))
}
.en-close__scene-copy h2{
  margin:0;color:rgb(var(--en-ink))!important;
  font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,44px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:normal;text-wrap:balance
}
.en-close__lede{margin:18px 0 0;color:rgb(var(--en-ink)/.80)!important;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5}

/* The three places as a ruled schedule, matching the hero's own list form. */
.en-close__places{
  margin:clamp(24px,3vw,32px) 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;
  border-block-start:1px solid rgb(var(--en-ink)/.26)
}
.en-close__places li{border-block-end:1px solid rgb(var(--en-ink)/.26)}
.en-close__place{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto auto 1fr auto;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;
  padding:13px 8px;margin-inline:-8px;
  color:inherit!important;text-decoration:none;
  transition:background-color .18s ease
}
.en-close__place:hover{background:rgb(var(--en-ink)/.07)}
.en-close__place-go{color:rgb(var(--en-ink)/.62)!important;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;transition:transform .18s ease}
.en-close__place:hover .en-close__place-go{color:rgb(var(--en-ink))!important;transform:translateX(-3px)}
.en-close__idx{
  color:rgb(var(--en-ink)/.55)!important;
  font-size:12px;font-weight:700;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums
}
.en-close__places b{color:rgb(var(--en-ink))!important;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
.en-close__what{color:rgb(var(--en-ink)/.74)!important;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}

.en-close__scene-cta{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;align-self:flex-start;gap:8px;
  min-height:52px;margin-top:clamp(22px,3vw,30px);padding:12px 28px;border-radius:0;
  border:1px solid rgb(var(--en-ink));background:rgb(var(--en-ink));
  color:rgb(var(--en-night))!important;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;
  transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease
}
.en-close__scene-cta:hover{background:#fff;border-color:#fff}

/* Foot notes: label over note, separated by rules, no tiles and no circles. */
.en-close__notes{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));
  margin:clamp(40px,5vw,60px) 0 0;padding:0;
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--rule)
}
.en-close__notes>div{
  padding:20px clamp(14px,2vw,24px);
  border-inline-start:1px solid var(--rule);
  border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule)
}
.en-close__notes>div:first-child{border-inline-start:0}
.en-close__notes dt{margin:0 0 6px;color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;font-size:16px;font-weight:700}
.en-close__notes dd{margin:0;color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary))!important;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}

.en-close__learn{margin-top:clamp(48px,6vw,76px)}
.en-close__learn h2{
  margin:0 0 clamp(18px,2.4vw,26px);color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;
  font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:normal
}
.en-close__guides{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--rule-strong)
}
.en-close__guides a{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;
  padding:clamp(22px,2.6vw,30px) clamp(16px,2vw,26px);
  border-inline-start:1px solid var(--rule);border-block-end:1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;text-decoration:none;
  transition:background-color .18s ease
}
.en-close__guides a:first-child{border-inline-start:0}
.en-close__guides a:hover{background:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.05)}
.en-close__guides strong{color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;font-size:clamp(20px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:normal}
.en-close__guide-what{color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary))!important;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}
.en-close__guide-go{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;
  margin-top:clamp(14px,2vw,22px);padding-block-start:14px;
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--rule);
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;font-size:14px;font-weight:600
}
.en-close__guide-go b{font-size:18px;transition:transform .18s ease}
.en-close__guides a:hover .en-close__guide-go b{transform:translateX(-3px)}

.en-close__final{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:24px;
  margin-top:clamp(48px,6vw,76px);padding-block-start:clamp(26px,3vw,34px);
  border-block-start:1px solid var(--rule-strong)
}
.en-close__final h2{
  margin:0;color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;
  font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:normal
}
.en-close__final-note{
  margin:8px 0 0;color:rgb(var(--en-text-secondary))!important;
  font-size:16px;line-height:1.5
}
.en-close__final-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.en-close__final-actions a{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  min-height:52px;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:0;
  border:1px solid rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.42);
  color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary))!important;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;
  transition:background-color .18s ease,border-color .18s ease
}
.en-close__final-actions a:hover{border-color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary));background:rgb(var(--en-text-primary)/.06)}
.en-close__final-actions a.is-primary{
  border-color:rgb(var(--en-text-primary));background:rgb(var(--en-text-primary));
  color:rgb(var(--en-surface-page))!important
}
.en-close__final-actions a.is-primary:hover{background:rgb(var(--en-color-dark));border-color:rgb(var(--en-color-dark))}

.en-close a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid rgb(var(--en-text-primary));outline-offset:3px}
.en-close__scene a:focus-visible{outline-color:rgb(var(--en-ink))}

@media(max-width:900px){
  .en-close__scene{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .en-close__scene-media{min-height:320px}
  .en-close__notes{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .en-close__notes>div{border-inline-start:0;padding-inline:0}
  .en-close__guides{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .en-close__guides a{border-inline-start:0;padding-inline:0}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .en-close__wrap{padding-inline:16px}
  .en-close__place{grid-template-columns:auto 1fr auto;row-gap:2px}
  .en-close__what{grid-column:1 / 3}
  .en-close__scene-cta,.en-close__final-actions,.en-close__final-actions a{width:100%}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.en-close *{transition:none!important}}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ElmsNest closing spread",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "ElmsNest closing spread" }]
}
{% endschema %}
